; Original Astra: Dusk Signal. 16 bars, 4/4, E minor, 96 BPM.
; Finite original sampled instruments; three music channels, D reserved for SFX.
#title Astra Dusk Signal
#tempo 96
#grid 4
#inst dusk samples/dusk-pad.wav root=c4 vol=34
#inst beacon samples/beacon.wav root=c4 vol=30
#inst bass samples/rounded-bass.wav root=c3 vol=46
#inst kick samples/soft-kick.wav root=c4 vol=38
#inst snare samples/hushed-snare.wav root=c4 vol=26

; A: warm detuned open-fifth swells/stabs. Each half-note is a finite sample.
; Harmony: Em / Em / C / C / Am / Am / Bsus / Bsus, then a darker return.
A @dusk q8 v15 o3 e2 v10 e2 | v14 e2 r2
A v15 c2 v10 c2 | v13 c2 r2
A o2 v15 a2 v10 a2 | v14 a2 r2
A v14 b2 v9 b2 | v12 b2 r2
A o3 v15 e2 v11 e2 | v14 e2 r2
A v15 c2 v10 c2 | v13 c2 r2
A o2 v15 a2 v10 a2 | o3 v14 c2 r2
A o2 v14 b2 v9 b2 | v12 b2 r2

; B: sparse beacon, quieter sequential repeats, and snare on beat 3.
; Lead and backbeat replace one another on Paula 1; no independent delay bus.
B q8 @beacon o4 v15 e4 v6 e4 @snare o4 v15 c4 r4
B r2 @snare o4 v13 c4 @beacon o3 v10 b4
B @beacon o4 v13 g4 v5 g4 @snare o4 v15 c4 r4
B r2 @snare o4 v12 c4 @beacon o4 v10 e4
B @beacon o4 v13 e4 v5 e4 @snare o4 v15 c4 r4
B r2 @snare o4 v13 c4 @beacon o4 v10 c4
B @beacon o4 v12 f+4 v5 f+4 @snare o4 v14 c4 r4
B r2 @snare o4 v11 c4 r4
B @beacon o4 v14 g4 v6 g4 @snare o4 v15 c4 r4
B @beacon o4 v10 e4 v4 e4 @snare o4 v13 c4 r4
B @beacon o3 v13 b4 v5 b4 @snare o4 v15 c4 r4
B r2 @snare o4 v12 c4 @beacon o4 v9 e4
B @beacon o4 v12 c4 v5 c4 @snare o4 v14 c4 r4
B @beacon o3 v12 b4 v5 b4 @snare o4 v12 c4 r4
B @beacon o4 v12 f+4 v5 f+4 @snare o4 v14 c4 r4
B @beacon o4 v10 d+4 v4 d+4 @snare o4 v10 c4 r4

; C: kicks occupy bass gaps on beats 1/3; bass enters on the offbeat.
; Eight eighths per bar. Natural decays leave breathing room between pulses.
C q8 @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 e4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o2 v12 b4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 e4. @kick o4 v11 c8 @bass o2 v12 e4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 c4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o1 v12 g4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 c4. @kick o4 v11 c8 @bass o2 v12 c4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o1 v15 a4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o2 v12 e4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o1 v15 a4. @kick o4 v11 c8 @bass o1 v12 a4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o1 v15 b4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o2 v12 f+4.
C @kick o4 v13 c8 @bass o1 v13 b4. r2
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 e4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o2 v12 b4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 e4. @kick o4 v11 c8 @bass o2 v12 e4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 c4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o1 v12 g4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 c4. @kick o4 v11 c8 @bass o2 v12 c4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o1 v15 a4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o2 v12 e4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o2 v15 c4. @kick o4 v11 c8 @bass o1 v12 g4.
C @kick o4 v15 c8 @bass o1 v15 b4. @kick o4 v12 c8 @bass o2 v12 f+4.
C @kick o4 v13 c8 @bass o1 v13 b4. r2

; Full-length silence. Only global tracker timing effects may occupy D.
D [r1]16
